  "_accountComment": [
    "AccountType is case-sensitive server-side (^(Checking|Savings|MoneyMarket|CD|Loan|Credit)$).",
    "",
    "NO ACCOUNT IS OWNED BY A BANKER OR A SUPERVISOR, deliberately and permanently.",
    "docs/design/banker-customer-read-ruling.md §B6: the banker-owned accounts existed only",
    "because GetAccountTransactions filtered by the CALLER's userId, so a banker reading a",
    "customer's account got 200 [] — a success asserting a falsehood. The data was shaped so a",
    "defect would not show, which made the workaround the design. Now the customers own the",
    "accounts and the histories, and the banker works their cases.",
    "",
    "Each owner's accountTypes are UNIQUE. seed_accounts claims the first unclaimed existing",
    "account of a type, and demo:show re-derives the evidence subject by type, so two accounts",
    "of one type under one owner would make 'which one' depend on server ordering.",
    "",
    "The histories are load-bearing, not decoration. Livingston measured the supervisor",
    "reasoning about real ledger contents — it proceeded on an account that genuinely held",
    "three near-identical credits and held on one that did not. Keep the empty account, the",
    "near-threshold pattern and the duplicate-looking pattern; only the ownership moved."
  ],
